{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/src/views/thread.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:11:39.204228Z","id":"da32124b293752e72af9e27908c4eaef923dbaf35a2ebc257a47ea72a3eee493","body":{"detail":"Moved from crates/clax-server/src/feedback.rs:1569-1613, record e7b6d312.\n\nSpec §8.3 gives a thread withheld: {count, authors, approval} whenever any field is withheld but does not say what count counts. Withhold::thread counts withheld comments (the number the feedback line and approval requests speak of), so a thread whose only withheld field is its anchor, clip, resolved_by or a batch note has count 0.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:f0c796f80dc9dbbf63c5693b5d64e10679acfcca","span":{"start":{"line":944},"end":{"line":988},"content_hash":"472a63a615cac43e0ca525689a793d0aab4ecaadecaaef4ad8767556155767a4"},"summary":"A thread's withheld.count counts its withheld comment bodies only","tags":["visibility","spec:8.3","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
